1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:09,980
Slide 40 brings us to the spiritual foundation of our entire curriculum: "SOLI DEO GLORIA: REDEEMING THE TIME."

2
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:22,400
Look at Card 1: "THE MANDATE: Ephesians 5:16 — 'Redeeming the time, because the days are evil.'" Time is the ultimate non-renewable treasure God has given to each of us.

3
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:30,890
Look at Card 2: "THE MOTIVE." We do not engineer autonomous systems so we can waste our lives in selfish comfort or laziness!

4
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:39,210
We build them to liberate our minds from repetitive digital slavery so we can pursue deep scholarship, prayer, and serving our neighbors!

5
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:47,120
When our routine work is handled with excellence, we have the cognitive peace to be truly present for the people who need us.

6
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:51,398
And Card 3: "THE GLORY." Soli Deo Gloria.

7
00:00:51,398 --> 00:01:03,430
Every line of Python, every mathematical equation, and every cloud container finds its highest dignity when it honors God and blesses human lives.

